            <h3 style="color:#fff; margin-bottom:6px;">No matching items found</h3>
            <p style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem;">Try searching with <code>@modname</code> (e.g. <code>@create</code>, <code>@cataclysm</code>) or a broader term.</p>
